<p local-id=3D"f8c7e95d-ea83-4d4d-8ed5-4c96960e363e">Timing code of message=
 communication<br>
- DO: Day Opening (Before or At Market Opening)<br>
- ONO: Online (From Day Opening until Market Closing)<br>
- ONT: Online (Trading Hours)<br>
- ONB: Online (From Market Opening until Daily Batch)<br>
- ALL: All Day<br>
- MC: Market Closing<br>
- DB: Daily Batch<br>
- DC: Day Closing (EOD, End of Day)&nbsp;</p>
